  The changes: nothing online (no lobby or presence, no usage pings, no
  match-result uploads, no link shortener, no high-score links); the game-over
  "Back to Lobby" button is "Menu" and opens this app's game list; the page is
  trimmed to the game and its controls help; the Exo font comes from this
  site; the sounds are this site's own; the three-cushion table has plain
  cloth instead of a cloth photo whose source isn't stated.

